IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-22`

-- Tests of Article 22. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- Placement dates: the Annex III fixture is placed 2 December 2027 (`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027`) or 2 December 2028 (`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028`); Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027.
-- Asked on 2 December 2027 about the system placed on 2 December 2028, the days left before the first making available are 366 (the span includes 29 February 2028).

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- Art 22(3)(a) to (e) and the last sentence, positional: (a), (b), (c), (d), registration obligations apply, (e), addressed by the competent authorities.
`P3 mandate complete` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 mandate complete without registration` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking registration task` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking (a)` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking (b)` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking (c)` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking (d)` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 mandate lacking the last sentence` MEANS `Art 22(3) what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE


§ `Art 22(1): a provider established in a third country appoints an authorised representative by written mandate`

-- args: the provider's place; it has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate; that representative is established in the Union
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A provider established in the Union: the paragraph does not speak (NOTHING-kind, limited by its own wording).
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in the Union` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in the Union` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(1) the provider established in a third country has appointed an authorised representative by written mandate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 22(2): the provider enables its authorised representative`

#ASSERT `Art 22(2) the provider has enabled its authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(2) the provider has enabled its authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(2) the provider has enabled its authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 22(3): the tasks of the mandate and the copy of the mandate upon request`

#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative performs the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative performs the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative performs the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
