#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative has provided a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities upon request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
