#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative has provided a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities upon request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the authorised representative has provided a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities upon request` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 22(3)(a) to (e) and the last sentence: what the mandate empowers the authorised representative to do`

#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate complete` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Where no registration obligation under Article 49(1) applies, point (e) asks nothing ("where applicable").
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate complete without registration` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking registration task` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking (a)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking (b)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking (c)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking (d)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate lacking the last sentence` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 mandate complete` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(3) the mandate empowers the authorised representative to carry out the tasks` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 mandate complete` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 22(4): terminating the mandate and then informing`

-- args: the authorised representative considers or has reason to consider the provider to be acting contrary to its obligations; the mandate is terminated
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has terminated the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has terminated the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has terminated the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has terminated the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has terminated the mandate` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the same reason; informed the relevant market surveillance authority; there is a relevant notified body; informed it
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 22(4) the authorised representative has informed the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body of the termination and the reasons` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces`

-- Art 22(1): the first making available is the placement date of the system (2 December 2028); asked on 2 December 2027 there are 366 days left (inclusive).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 22(1) appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` AT 100
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 22(1) appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` AT 366
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 22(1) appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` AT 367
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- A provider established in the Union owes no appointment; before the group applies nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in the Union` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(1) the provider's duty to appoint an authorised representative by written mandate prior to making its high-risk AI system available on the Union market` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `Established or located in a third country` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 22(2) and (3): no time limit stated.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(2) the provider's duty to enable its authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 22(2) enable the authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 22(2) the provider's duty to enable its authorised representative to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(3) the authorised representative's duty to perform the tasks specified in the mandate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(3) perform the tasks specified in the mandate received from the provider` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(3) the authorised representative's duty to provide a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities upon request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(3) provide a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(3) the authorised representative's duty to provide a copy of the mandate to the market surveillance authorities upon request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 22(4): terminate, then inform on the day of the termination ("immediately": the same day).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(4) the authorised representative's duty to terminate the mandate and then immediately inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(4) terminate the mandate` AT 5
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(4) inform the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body about the termination and the reasons` AT 5
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 22(4) the authorised representative's duty to terminate the mandate and then immediately inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(4) terminate the mandate` AT 5
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(4) inform the relevant market surveillance authority and, where applicable, the relevant notified body about the termination and the reasons` AT 6
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 22(4) the authorised representative's duty to terminate the mandate and then immediately inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 22(4) terminate the mandate` AT 5
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Terminating with no time limit: nothing has happened yet, so the duty is still open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 22(4) the authorised representative's duty to terminate the mandate and then immediately inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 22(4) the authorised representative's duty to terminate the mandate and then immediately inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
